float joined(vec2 p){vec4 f=fieldSample(p);float crown=.75+uIntensity/100.,halfThickness=max(uSide*.012,uSide*.032*SExtrusion/100.)*crown/2.;return (halfThickness+f.z*crown)*sqrt(clamp(f.y/max(1.,uSide*.012),0.,1.));}
